Option Compare Database
Option Explicit

' The single canonical product version for the Access SCC Add-in.
' This is the one source of truth for the add-in version: the GitHub release
' tag (vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) MUST equal this value, and Init() stamps this value
' into the registry on every load (see StampInstalledVersion).
Public Const VERSION As String = "0.79.0"

' Registry location where the installed version is recorded on load.
Private Const VERSION_REG_KEY As String = "Software\x-ware-ltd\AccessSCC"
Private Const VERSION_REG_VALUE As String = "InstalledVersion"

'************************************************
' Stamp Installed Version
'
' Records the current product version (VERSION) in the registry at
' HKCU\Software\x-ware-ltd\AccessSCC\InstalledVersion (REG_SZ). The add-in's
' Init() entry point calls this on every load, so the value always reflects
' the version of the add-in that is actually installed and running. External
' tools (for example the jcshelper `check` command) read this value to verify
' the installed version.
'
' Any failure to write the registry is deliberately swallowed so that a
' registry problem can never prevent the add-in from loading.
'
' Version history:
'   - 1.00 initial version
'
' @version      1.00
'************************************************
Public Sub StampInstalledVersion()
  On Error Resume Next
  xwRegSetStringValue HKEY_CURRENT_USER, VERSION_REG_KEY, VERSION_REG_VALUE, VERSION
End Sub